// ---- Shader compiler implementation, names (0.22) ----
// The predeclared names of WGSL: keywords, types, attributes and builtins.
// The lexer interns them first, so each has the fixed symbol below. The
// math functions are in MF_* order (ir.vl): K_ABS + MF_x is MF_x's name.

